The static Linux Cgo executable includes the GNU C Library runtime.
The Linux matched decoder uses the normal shared libc and math libraries.

The tested build host uses libc6 2.39-0ubuntu8.9. COPYRIGHT is reproduced
unchanged from that package; its historical wording is retained.
COPYING.LGPLv2.1 supplies the referenced GNU Lesser General Public License.
The library source is not modified by this project.

Upstream source: https://sourceware.org/glibc/
